## Quick examples

```
Refine this into a story: users should get an ETA after reporting an issue.
File a bug from this test failure: <paste>
Help me write a clear epic for the new onboarding flow.
Draft a spike to evaluate two queue libraries.
This ticket is vague — clean it up before I create it.
```

---

## Notes / limitations

- Custom field IDs and issue-type names vary per Jira project — fall back to display names from `getJiraIssue`, or ask.
- Estimation style follows the **Team config**; never invent points — offer `needs-refinement` instead.
- Sprint, fix version, and release fields are intentionally left out of creation; they belong to planning, not refinement.
